    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start, the tone is definitely there. \n\nThe thing is, the automated system flagged this one for being \"shallow\"—apparently, because the word count is a bit low, it's not triggering the 'substantial content' flag in our engine. I know, I know, it's a stupid way to measure quality. \n\nCan you expand on this? Try to weave in more of that lore about the old gods she saw. Just... please, try to add actual new details or context rather than just using more adjectives. I really don't want to have to manually override the metric if we can avoid it.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
